#[doc = "# Decisions for Customer-operated recipe link import\n\n- [ADR 0004](../page_docs_adr_0004_licensing_hosting_and_sharing_md/index.html)\n- [ADR 0005](../page_docs_adr_0005_privacy_and_learning_md/index.html)\n\n## Feature-local decisions\n2026-11-07: Acceptance criteria capture the customer vision; unspecified implementation choices remain proposals. No future feature is implemented by this bootstrap.\n\n- [ADR 0023](../page_docs_adr_0023_reviewed_recipe_link_import_md/index.html): public retrieval boundaries,\n  non-executing extraction, explicit native review and atomic private import receipts.\n"]
