#[doc = "# Grouped ingredient discovery\n\nNative list rows replace repeated organizational source/record-ID metadata with a group name, subtype\ncount, expansion action and a separate details link. Search reveals subtype results directly; clearing\nsearch restores the user's browsing expansion. Ingredient selectors retain their own food identity and\nuse parent context for search, not automatic replacement or nutrition inheritance. Group titles are\nEnglish base names with German translations; the mapping contains no health, vegan or allergen claims.\n"]
