#[doc = "# Approved concept screens\n\nCustomer-approved German design references from 2026-11-10. These PNGs are drawings, not native browser acceptance screenshots. The concept is general-purpose; the bread example illustrates parallel prepared parts, merging and an actual completion-triggered timer.\n\n| Screen | Interaction |\n| --- | --- |\n| [Shared calendar](https://github.com/Th3Link/mealshop/blob/main/specs/0031-unified-preparation/screens/nextcloud-v3-01-gemeinsamer-speiseplan.png) | Meals and preparation in one meal plan |\n| [Mealprep allocation](https://github.com/Th3Link/mealshop/blob/main/specs/0031-unified-preparation/screens/nextcloud-v3-02-mealprep-verteilen.png) | One production, several eating days |\n| [Recipe editing](https://github.com/Th3Link/mealshop/blob/main/specs/0031-unified-preparation/screens/nextcloud-v3-03-allgemeines-rezept-bearbeiten.png) | General ingredients and instructions |\n| [Cooking](https://github.com/Th3Link/mealshop/blob/main/specs/0031-unified-preparation/screens/nextcloud-v3-04-zubereitung.png) | Next action and waiting timer |\n| [Sourdough editing](https://github.com/Th3Link/mealshop/blob/main/specs/0031-unified-preparation/screens/brot-mehrteilig-v4-01-sauerteig-bearbeiten.png) | Ingredients owned by a prepared part |\n| [Combining parts](https://github.com/Th3Link/mealshop/blob/main/specs/0031-unified-preparation/screens/brot-mehrteilig-v4-02-vorstufen-zusammenfuehren.png) | Reuse prepared parts without duplicate ingredients |\n| [Bread in the calendar](https://github.com/Th3Link/mealshop/blob/main/specs/0031-unified-preparation/screens/brot-mehrteilig-v4-03-brot-im-speiseplan.png) | Preparation alongside meals |\n| [Finishing mixing](https://github.com/Th3Link/mealshop/blob/main/specs/0031-unified-preparation/screens/brot-mehrteilig-v4-04-quellteig-fertig.png) | Completion starts the waiting time |\n| [Waiting](https://github.com/Th3Link/mealshop/blob/main/specs/0031-unified-preparation/screens/brot-mehrteilig-v4-05-quellzeit-laeuft.png) | Remaining time from the actual action |\n\nIcon attribution is retained in [icon-license.txt](https://github.com/Th3Link/mealshop/blob/main/specs/0031-unified-preparation/screens/icon-license.txt). These references do not override Nextcloud's native shell, theme, typography or accessible controls. See the parent specification, UX notes and validation evidence for implementation scope and unresolved acceptance.\n"]
