#[doc = "# Feature specifications\n\nEach stable NNNN-slug folder contains specification.md (what/why/acceptance), adrs.md\n(decisions) and plan.md (implementation and validation). Add ux-notes.md for UI features.\nLifecycle: Draft → Ready → In progress → Done. Draft implementation tasks are intentionally\nunchecked. Must means required for the intended product, not all in the initial milestone.\nNew folders take the next free number; keep index/status changes in the same commit.\n\nFeatures are grouped by status, then sorted by milestone and requirement ID.\n\n## In progress\n\n| Requirement | Feature | Priority | Milestone |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| F35 | [Flutter mobile client and smartphone delivery](../page_specs_0035_flutter_mobile_client_specification_md/index.html) | Must | M1 |\n| F18 | [Storage adapters, Nextcloud `ExApp` and Flutter](../page_specs_0018_storage_deployment_specification_md/index.html) | Must | M1 |\n\n## Draft\n\n| Requirement | Feature | Priority | Milestone |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| F29 | [Cross-client localization and versioned content translations](../page_specs_0029_cross_client_localization_specification_md/index.html) | Must | M1 |\n| F30 | [Standalone Vue client and cross-client integration](../page_specs_0030_standalone_vue_client_specification_md/index.html) | Must | M1 |\n| F19 | [Hosted plans, paid app and recipe marketplace](../page_specs_0019_commercial_service_specification_md/index.html) | Could | M4 |\n| F20 | [Federated recipe and meal-plan exchange](../page_specs_0020_federation_specification_md/index.html) | Could | M5 |\n\n## Done\n\n| Requirement | Feature | Priority | Milestone |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| F01 | [Server and delivery foundation](../page_specs_0001_bootstrap_specification_md/index.html) | Must | M0 |\n| F02 | [Ingredient catalogue and nutrition](../page_specs_0002_ingredients_nutrition_specification_md/index.html) | Must | M1 |\n| F03 | [Precise quantities and configurable units](../page_specs_0003_quantities_units_specification_md/index.html) | Must | M1 |\n| F04 | [Recipe authoring and scaling](../page_specs_0004_recipe_authoring_specification_md/index.html) | Must | M1 |\n| F09 | [Household members and dietary constraints](../page_specs_0009_household_profiles_specification_md/index.html) | Must | M1 |\n| F21 | [Nextcloud internationalization](../page_specs_0021_internationalization_specification_md/index.html) | Must | M1 |\n| F22 | [Native Nextcloud Vue client](../page_specs_0022_product_web_clients_specification_md/index.html) | Must | M1 |\n| F23 | [English-base kitchen ingredient catalogue](../page_specs_0023_kitchen_ingredient_catalogue_specification_md/index.html) | Must | M1 |\n| F24 | [Native Nextcloud daily workflows](../page_specs_0024_nextcloud_daily_workflows_specification_md/index.html) | Must | M1 |\n| F25 | [Ingredient groups and nutrition](../page_specs_0025_ingredient_groups_specification_md/index.html) | Must | M1 |\n| F26 | [Comfortable native authoring](../page_specs_0026_authoring_experience_specification_md/index.html) | Must | M1 |\n| F27 | [Complete catalogue organization](../page_specs_0027_catalogue_organization_specification_md/index.html) | Must | M1 |\n| F28 | [Native usability review](../page_specs_0028_native_usability_review_specification_md/index.html) | Must | M1 |\n| F05 | [Recipe sharing and collections](../page_specs_0005_sharing_collections_specification_md/index.html) | Must | M2 |\n| F06 | [Shopping lists and recipe provenance](../page_specs_0006_shopping_list_specification_md/index.html) | Must | M2 |\n| F07 | [Preferred shops and learned shopping order](../page_specs_0007_shops_order_learning_specification_md/index.html) | Should | M2 |\n| F10 | [Family meal planning and calendar attendance](../page_specs_0010_meal_planning_specification_md/index.html) | Must | M2 |\n| F11 | [Cooking history and online preference learning](../page_specs_0011_recommendation_feedback_specification_md/index.html) | Should | M2 |\n| F12 | [Guided cooking and preset timers](../page_specs_0012_guided_cooking_specification_md/index.html) | Must | M2 |\n| F31 | [Unified preparation, mealprep and ingredient extensions](../page_specs_0031_unified_preparation_specification_md/index.html) | Must | M2 |\n| F32 | [Visual household shopping](../page_specs_0032_visual_shopping_specification_md/index.html) | Must | M2 |\n| F33 | [Compact recipes and explicit homemade ingredients](../page_specs_0033_compact_recipe_preparation_specification_md/index.html) | Must | M2 |\n| F34 | [Source-backed nutrition ranges](../page_specs_0034_evidence_nutrition_ranges_specification_md/index.html) | Must | M2 |\n| F08 | [Barcode scanning and product matching](../page_specs_0008_barcode_specification_md/index.html) | Could | M3 |\n| F13 | [Multi-day bread, rolls and pizza scheduling](../page_specs_0013_bread_schedules_specification_md/index.html) | Should | M3 |\n| F15 | [Inventory and shopping offers](../page_specs_0015_inventory_offers_specification_md/index.html) | Should | M3 |\n| F16 | [Customer-operated recipe link import](../page_specs_0016_recipe_import_specification_md/index.html) | Should | M3 |\n| F17 | [MCP recipe tools](../page_specs_0017_mcp_specification_md/index.html) | Should | M3 |\n| F14 | [Brewing and fermentation workflows](../page_specs_0014_brewing_fermentation_specification_md/index.html) | Could | M4 |\n"]
